    "description": "The Similar Real Estate Listings API allows users to access comparable real estate listings based on specific criteria. By leveraging this API, real estate agents and developers can enhance their systems with functionality to display similar properties to potential buyers, facilitating more informed decision-making. This API returns a curated list of listings that match the characteristics of a given property, enabling users to easily explore alternatives. Typical consumers of this API include real estate platforms, mobile applications, and market analysis tools.",
